  "D-DENY-BLOCKER" "A native blocker is still open."
  "D-DENY-LABELS-UNKNOWN" "Label evidence is incomplete."
  "D-DENY-NATIVE-UNKNOWN" "Native dependency evidence is incomplete."
  "D-DENY-CLOSING-UNKNOWN" "Closing pull request evidence is incomplete."
  "D-DENY-PLATFORM" "The ticket names a platform the viewer is not known to run on."
  "D-DENY-REFINEMENT" "The ticket needs refinement: blocking questions must be answered and it must be re-estimated."
  "D-DENY-REESTIMATE" "Refinement was resolved; the ticket returns to estimation before implementation."
