 :denial-purposes
 {"D-DENY-CLAIM" "Keep already claimed tickets out of new implementation pickup."
  "D-DENY-PREREQUISITE" "Keep work with design, question, blocked or parked prerequisites out of implementation pickup."
  "D-DENY-OPEN-PR" "Avoid proposing a new implementation while an open PR already closes the ticket."
  "D-DENY-BLOCKER" "Keep tickets with open native blockers out of implementation pickup."
  "D-DENY-LABELS-UNKNOWN" "Withhold implementation pickup when label evidence is incomplete."
  "D-DENY-NATIVE-UNKNOWN" "Withhold implementation pickup when native dependency evidence is incomplete."
  "D-DENY-CLOSING-UNKNOWN" "Withhold implementation pickup when existing closing PRs cannot be ruled out."
  "D-DENY-PLATFORM" "Keep platform-restricted work out of pickup without a matching viewer platform."
  "D-DENY-REFINEMENT" "Keep work that needs refinement out of pickup, whatever its estimate or readiness label says."
  "D-DENY-REESTIMATE" "Return resolved refinement to estimation instead of admitting it straight to implementation."
  "D-DENY-REFINEMENT-UNKNOWN" "Fail closed when refinement evidence could not be read completely."
  "D-DENY-INVENTORY-UNKNOWN" "Withhold new implementation pickup while the viewer's claim inventory is incomplete."}}
